# Placeholder so `frontend/dist/` exists on a fresh clone.
#
# `backend/pyproject.toml` has a hatchling `[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel.force-include]`
# rule that maps `../frontend/dist` into the wheel as `app/_frontend_dist`.
# Without this directory existing, `pip install -e backend/.[server,dev]`
# fails before frontend has ever been built.
#
# This file is tracked in git; the rest of `frontend/dist/` is gitignored
# (see `.gitignore`). When `npm run build` runs, it overwrites everything
# in this directory except this `.gitkeep` itself.
